# Test the elementwise proof chain in all quotient hyperfields F_p/U, p small.
# Chain to verify for every a,b with 1 ∈ a⊞b (set c=-1, w=ab):
#   Step 1: g∈a³⊞b³, m ∈ M := (a²b)"'^{⊞3}⊞(ab²)''^{⊞3}, 0 ∈ g⊞m⊞(-1)     [proved by A2]
